  <h2 id="proof">Testing a track before you commit further years</h2>

  <p>
    A qualification checklist tells you what is formally required. It cannot tell you whether you
    will actually get hired, or enjoy the work, before you spend more years finding out the hard
    way. Test that first, using <strong>The 3 Gates</strong>.
  </p>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <p class="gates-block__title">
      Do not accept a postdoc offer, start a CSIR scientist attempt, or leap into freelance
      regulatory writing before passing all three gates below.
    </p>
    <div class="gates-row">
      {gateItems.map((item) => (
        <div class="gate">
